config SERVICE_WELLBEING
    bool "Wellbeing"
    depends on SERVICE_ACTIVITY
    depends on SERVICE_HRM
    help
      Night mode for the backlight, the move reminder and overnight readiness.
      The first two are driven by the sleep and step data the activity service
      already collects; readiness reads the heart-rate sensor.

if SERVICE_WELLBEING

module = SERVICE_WELLBEING
module-str = Wellbeing
source "subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_level"

endif
